  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project for Enhancing Border Management Capacity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen operational capacities of border management authorities and agencies to contribute towards a comprehensive migration management and integrated border management system and thereby, prevent irregular migration. The proposed will be achieved through the following three key outcomes:   Outcome I: Border management agencies effectively mange borders and prevent irregular migration  Outcome 2: Immigration and Border Management agencies demonstrate improved technological capacities to efficiently manage borders and curb irregular migration Outcome 3: Immigration and Border Management authorities support migrants in irregular situations through improved facilities, procedures and knowledge.</narrative>
  </description>
